		and close the block. Both operands already have typed temporaries.`)
		(params (source (shared-array u8)) (nodes (shared-array SourceNode)) (records (shared-array ScalarRecord))
			(index i32) (parent i32) (left bool) (symbol u8) (output (mut-array u8)) (offset u32) (name_prefix i32) (writing bool))
		(returns u32)
